### Reports — cần device auth
### Điền @deviceId + @deviceToken sau khi register (xem 30-devices.http)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@deviceId =
@deviceToken =
@spotId = REPLACE_WITH_SPOT_UUID

### Báo spot — type: confirm | missing | closed | issue
### issue chỉ dùng với type=issue, issueCode tuỳ chọn (vd "closed-gate", "construction")
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/spots/{{spotId}}/reports
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "issue",
  "issueCode": "closed-gate"
}

### Báo crowd level tại spot — level: 1 quiet | 2 moderate | 3 busy
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/spots/{{spotId}}/crowd-reports
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "level": 2
}

### Feedback điểm số — verdict: 1 = hay | 0 = bình thường | -1 = dở
### tsHour phải trong quá khứ ≤72h hoặc tương lai ≤7 ngày (RFC3339)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/scores/feedback
X-Device-ID: {{deviceId}}
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spotId": "{{spotId}}",
  "tsHour": "2026-11-18T10:00:00+07:00",
  "verdict": 1
}
